  message: "Already landed in 7920564022 (2026-06-11, merged to dev) as validator:F1 / G1: tests/test_validation_report_empty.py — a shrink-only 4-substrate ratchet (default/frameworks_all/include_docs/max_tier_4) over the schema-coverage-corpus, co-ratcheting ADR-0023 runtime_coherence offenders, with a liveness floor that prevents a vacuous pass. Realized as a shrink-only ratchet rather than the literal ADR-0033 assert-empty form because the corpus carries real open defects (an assert-empty gate would be permanently red). ADR-0033 amended (CI-gate-realization, 2026-06-11) and CHANGELOG updated. Behavioral evidence: re-ran the gate 2026-06-12 -> 4 passed, exit 0 (/tmp/validator-f1-gate-run.log)."  # 9636
